{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17174","headline":"南亭晓坐因以示璩 · 权德舆","name":"南亭晓坐因以示璩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐几日无事，风交松桂枝。\n园庐含晓霁，草木发华姿。\n迹似南山隐，官从小宰移。\n万殊同野马，方寸即灵龟。\n弱质常多病，流年近始衰。\n图书传授处，家有一男儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}